---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy & SMS terms" showBanner={false}>
  <section class="section wrap" style="max-width: 760px;">
    <h1 style="margin-bottom: 24px;">Privacy &amp; SMS terms</h1>
    <h3>What we collect</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">When you join the waitlist or apply, we collect your name, phone number, email and the details you give us about your household. Rental applications are processed through our leasing software, AppFolio, under its own privacy policy.</p>
    <h3>How we use it</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">To tell you about units that match what you asked for, to process applications and leases, and to meet the income-certification requirements of the Bill 7 program. We do not sell your information.</p>
    <h3>Text messages</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">By providing your mobile number and checking the consent box, you agree to receive text messages from Anchor Rentals about unit availability and your application. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP at any time to opt out, or HELP for help. Consent is not a condition of renting.</p>
    <h3>Fair housing</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">Anchor Rentals complies with the federal Fair Housing Act and Hawaii Revised Statutes Chapter 515. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex, familial status, national origin, disability, age, ancestry, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, HIV infection, or source of income.</p>
    <h3>Contact</h3>
    <p>Anchor Rentals, a DBA of Oceans Real Estate LLC · 7192 Kalanianaʻole Hwy, Suite A143A, Honolulu, HI 96825 · <a href="mailto:leasing@anchorrentalshawaii.com">leasing@anchorrentalshawaii.com</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>
